\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {S18}{\ignorespaces Model size and training cost on one GPU. \emph  {Peak memory}: largest allocation during training, the section resident on the GPU. \emph  {Run time}: one whole fit; for DISCELL with its evaluations every five epochs and the early stop, the range over the three final seeds; for the comparison methods, the training time of the lineage-label fit compared here. Every method is fitted on whole sections. Arrows give the preferred direction; bold marks the best value per section: the fastest finished fit, for DISCELL by its mean. $^{a}$Could not be run on the resources currently available; measured reason: SIMVI, ovarian FFPE: out of GPU memory on a 24 GB card (a further 7.67 GiB requested with 15.87 GiB in use); SIMVI, lung FFPE: out of GPU memory on a 24 GB card (a further 5.16 GiB requested with 21.27 GiB in use); SIMVI, ovarian FF: out of GPU memory on a 24 GB card (a further 40.00 MiB requested with 23.47 GiB in use); MintFlow, ovarian FF: an earlier attempt was stopped for lack of host memory before training (1,157,343 cells, 5,001 genes; an estimated 92 GB needed on a 125 GB host); a retry needs 110 GB free and 102 GB were available.\relax }}{26}{table.caption.59}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:timing}{{S18}{26}{Model size and training cost on one GPU. \emph {Peak memory}: largest allocation during training, the section resident on the GPU. \emph {Run time}: one whole fit; for DISCELL with its evaluations every five epochs and the early stop, the range over the three final seeds; for the comparison methods, the training time of the lineage-label fit compared here. Every method is fitted on whole sections. Arrows give the preferred direction; bold marks the best value per section: the fastest finished fit, for DISCELL by its mean. $^{a}$Could not be run on the resources currently available; measured reason: SIMVI, ovarian FFPE: out of GPU memory on a 24 GB card (a further 7.67 GiB requested with 15.87 GiB in use); SIMVI, lung FFPE: out of GPU memory on a 24 GB card (a further 5.16 GiB requested with 21.27 GiB in use); SIMVI, ovarian FF: out of GPU memory on a 24 GB card (a further 40.00 MiB requested with 23.47 GiB in use); MintFlow, ovarian FF: an earlier attempt was stopped for lack of host memory before training (1,157,343 cells, 5,001 genes; an estimated 92 GB needed on a 125 GB host); a retry needs 110 GB free and 102 GB were available.\relax }{table.caption.59}{}}
\newlabel{tab:timing@cref}{{[table][18][]S18}{[1][24][]26}}
